# documentation(Dog)
_Dog {s7.R}_

## A dog

------

*Inherits from `Animal`.*

### Usage

```r
Dog(name, age = 0, good = TRUE)
```

### Arguments

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
| `name` | The dog's name. |
| `age` | How old it is, in years. |
| `good` | Whether it is a good dog. |

