# documentation(Range)
_Range {s7.R}_

## A range

------

### Usage

```r
Range(x)
```

### Arguments

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
| `x` | Values to span. |

### Properties

- `start`: The bounds.
- `end`: The bounds.

