# documentation(speak)
_speak {s7.R}_

## Make a noise

------

### Usage

```r
speak(x, ...)
```

### Arguments

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
| `x` | An animal. |
| `...` | Passed on to methods. |

### Methods

- `speak(<Dog>)`: Dogs bark
- `speak(<Animal>)`

